Model weights

The weights published as boxwrench/Ling-3.1-flash-exl3-wrench-2.10bpw are a
quantized derivative of inclusionAI/Ling-3.1-flash. The base model card declares:

    license: mit

and links to the Ling-3.1-flash model page:

    https://huggingface.co/inclusionAI/Ling-3.1-flash

The base model's MIT terms are reproduced in this repository's LICENSE for the
derivative distribution. The base model is the work of inclusionAI; the
quantized conversion is the work of boxwrench. No endorsement by inclusionAI is
implied.

Upstream tools

The conversion recipe and benchmark runner use turboderp-org/exllamav3, which is
distributed under the MIT License:

    https://github.com/turboderp-org/exllamav3

The EXL3 trellis method builds on QTIP. The benchmark inputs include source text
from llama.cpp (MIT) and one public-domain book from the PG-19 dataset. Those
inputs are identified by source and SHA-256 in results/results.json; their
upstream licenses continue to apply.
